function dailyPlanPage(){const p=plan(),items=[['textbook','新东方当天一句','教材原音、指读和当天默写','sentence'],['recognition','5词认读纠正',p.drill,'cards'],['raz','RAZ F独立阅读','先独立读，再听音核对；记录2–3个“听懂但认不出”的词','raz'],['ket',`KET专项：${p.ket}`,'5–8个阅读/语法小题，记录首次成绩','ket'],['output','英语输出',p.output,'output'],['log','家长四项记录','默写错误数、认读/5、RAZ/5、KET/5','log']];view.innerHTML=`<div class="learning"><div class="heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">DAY ${String(selectedDay).padStart(2,'0')} · ${esc(p.phase)}</div><h1>${p.sentenceId==='复习'?'综合评估与复盘':p.hasLessonText?`Sentence ${esc(p.sentenceId)} 的完整训练`:`旧词巩固 · 第 ${selectedDay} 天`}</h1><p class="muted">总计约60分钟；疲劳时可以拆成早晚两段。</p></div>${btn('home','返回首页','text-button')}</div><div class="panel"><div class="section-label"><h2>按顺序完成</h2><span class="pill">${studyCount()} / 6</span></div>${items.map(([key,title,sub,target],i)=>`<div class="task"><span class="task-icon">${studyTasks()[key]?'✓':String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><div class="task-text"><h3>${esc(title)}</h3><small>${esc(sub)}</small></div>${btn('open-study',studyTasks()[key]?'复看':'开始',studyTasks()[key]?'':'secondary',`data-study="${key}" data-target="${target}"`)}</div>`).join('')}</div><div class="note space"><p><b>间隔复测：</b>新词在第1、2、4、7天随机复现；连续两次独立认读且理解正确，才转到阅读自然复现。错词保留在复习小站。</p></div></div>`;}
